              BREIE bit is set and cleared by
              software.</description>
              <bitOffset>3</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>SBPEIE</name>
              <description>Short Bit Period Error Interrupt Enable
